# Razor Furina Fischl Charlotte. ~23s rotation. You can do a 21s Rotation at no loss to DPS. Superconduct covers nearly the entirety of Razor's Field time. Razor TSr5 w/ Phys cup MH > SSr1 w/ Atk cup MH. Furina ToM > GT.

# Team- Options listsed by DPS
razor char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
razor add weapon="tidalshadow" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#razor add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
